window.products.push({"id":879057,"name":"South Shore Fakto Mates Bed with Storage Drawers Full Rustic Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dIN2-wByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 drawers underneath: three drawers are hidden under the bed, for extra storage – something you can never have too much of! Sturdy slides: we prefer metal slides, which are more secure… so each drawer can hold up to 25 lbs. Multi-functional Furniture: the mates bed is, first of all, a place to sleep – but it also gives you a lot of storage for clothes, shoes, or toys. 5-year limited guarantee: South Shore is Proud to stand behind this mates bed with 3 storage drawers with an exclusive 5-year limited guarantee. Shop with Confidence knowing your purchase is always covered. Easy assembly instructions: all products come with a clear assembly document that will guide you through all steps. If you have any questions during the assembly do not hesitate to contact South Shore Furniture for immediate support. This Item is shipped in 2 boxes, make sure to have a friend with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dIN2-wByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B07FMHH8F8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMHH8F8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMHH8F8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879058,"name":"Hoteelee Beer Can Glass with Silicone Lids and Glass Straws,4 Pack 16.9oz Drinking Tumbler with Colorful Silicone Sleeve,Can Shaped Glass Cups,Iced Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712J6HlKzsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Beer Glass Set: The glass tumbler with straws and lids set includes 4* 16.9oz can-shaped glass cups, 4*silicone lids and sleeve(pink,green,purple,yellow), 4* reusable glass straws and 2* cleaning brush.You can easily use this glass cups to combine with different accessories to meet your different needs. Simple Modern Beer Can Design: The whole looking of this glassware is designed to replicate a beer can to capture rich foam and aroma of a delicious soda or beer, and impact the drinking experience, aesthetically pleasing with this modern and stylish shape. It caters to the way you used to holding beer cans, so it is very handy to grab and toast for gracious entertaining. Diswasher Safe & Freeze Safe: The nice clean look create a surprising presentation for your favorite cocktail recipes, SO CUTE for SODA, SMOOTHIES or BOBA. So go ahead and chill them down for an icy cold brew that hits the spot perfectly! Multi-Purpose:The can shaped glass cups is perfect for highlighting the color and garnishes of specialty mixed drinks, iced coffee and crafted cocktails. Great for beer, coffee, tea, juice, iced drinks, soda, milk. Very popular in homes, cafes, bars and restaurants. Amazing Gift: This jar is very fashionable, beautiful and characteristic. Excellent workmanship. Perfect for Birthdays, House warming gifts, Tea Sets, Home Bars, Graduation, Weddings, Bachelorette Parties and Christmas Gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712J6HlKzsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoteelee","source_asin":"B0B4NBWGCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4NBWGCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4NBWGCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
