window.products.push({"id":879214,"name":"GILLAS Bathroom Over The Toilet Storage Shelf, Farmhouse Bathroom Storage Organizer with Toilet Paper Holder, Space Saver White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MCaTPMEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional Storage Rack: Space-saving toilet storage shelf effectively utilizes the space over the toilet, organize various items in the bathroom, reduce bathroom clutter, and increase bathroom storage space to make your bathroom clean and tidy Ample Storage Space: This multi-purpose bathroom storage organizer for all your bath essentials, such as toiletries, toilet paper, shaving-foam,shampoo, potted plants, magazines, etc. Open Bottom Design: Over the toilet shelf mesh grid design allows air circulation and reduces dust build-up, ensures breathable and no odor and no more stagnant water to keep toilet paper clean, dry Sturdy Stable for Safe Use: GILLAS bathroom over the toilet storage is made of high-quality hard iron, which is durable. The surface is easy cleaning, which makes long-time using possible","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MCaTPMEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GILLAS","source_asin":"B0B3QYJNJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3QYJNJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3QYJNJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879215,"name":"Manual Inspirational Collection Tapestry Throw, Forever a Father, 50 X 60-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xtvs8iqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Father, When we love, we forever keep that love in our heart. For love is immortal. Our memories preserve what is true, and remind us of the past. So in times when you feel alone, look within your heart and know I will always be there. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xtvs8iqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B0093EHFTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0093EHFTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0093EHFTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
