window.products.push({"id":879305,"name":"Ultimate Textile Miranda 60 x 108-Inch Rectangular Damask Tablecloth English Rose Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aFAOH4BjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Miranda Damask tablecloths offer a rich floral pattern in a two-tone contrasting color scheme. Sewn from a cotton-polyester blend, Miranda fabric is wrinkle and stain resistant. The English Rose 60 x 108 Inch Rectangular Miranda Tablecloths are an excellent choice for your wedding, party, home dining, Christmas and Thanksgiving dinners and other special events. Due to variations in computer monitors, colors shades may vary in appearance from screen to screen. The number of pieces per pack is equal to the pack name. Please search Ultimate Textile for matching and complementary items in all shapes and sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aFAOH4BjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ultimate Textile","source_asin":"B07JP2SQWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JP2SQWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JP2SQWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879306,"name":"RRG The Premier Series Super Soft Sheet Set from 100% Tencel (Queen, Dove Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81by-yPHIeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RRG has been providing bed sheets and linens to luxury resorts and hotels around the world for years and is now bringing these bed linens to your home. We supply the most exclusive and luxurious 5-star resorts and hotels, and feel that you should be able to enjoy the comfort of and deep sleep on these bed linens not only on vacation, but in your own home. These Tencel bed sheets are strong enough to stand up to the rigors of hotel washing and are soft enough to impress even the most discerning guests. They are softer than the finest 1200 thread count Egyptian cotton; we invite you to try our incredibly soft and silky bed sheets and pillowcases, and see how Tencel beats cotton and bamboo, hands down. The sheets and pillowcases are made from 100% Tencel lyocell from Eucalyptus and provide a more sustainable alternative to other bedding options while maintaining the peak of luxury and comfort. They’re significantly more eco-friendly than cotton because Eucalyptus trees do not need herbicides, pesticides, or irrigation to grow. While these linens are incredibly soft and smooth coming right out of the bag, they actually get even softer after being washed a few times! Their wash directions are easy; they can be washed in cold or warm water with like fabrics and dried on low heat, then laid right back on the mattress, no ironing or pressing needed. We do not recommend the use of fabric softener with them. These Tencel sheets have unique qualities in that they wick moisture very well which helps them keep you cool in the warmer months, and still are soft and cozy enough to keep you warm in colder seasons! We’re confident you’ll find our cozy bed sheets to be the softest, highest quality Tencel sheets you’ll ever sleep on. So confident that we think you’ll enjoy one of the best night’s sleep of your life on them!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81by-yPHIeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RRG","source_asin":"B01G7K0NGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G7K0NGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G7K0NGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879307,"name":"Frost Bright 3 Piece Salt and Pepper Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u12DnYKmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"3SPC5158 Features: -Set includes 1 salt shaker 1 pepper shaker and caddy. -Top rack dishwasher safe. Item: -Salt And Pepper Sets. Material: -Ceramic. Color: -Green and blue. Number of Items Included: -3. Seasonal Theme: -Yes. Season: -Winter. Dimensions: Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -4.33\". Overall Width - Side to Side: -3.66\". Overall Depth - Front to Back: -2.48\". Overall Product Weight: -0.4 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u12DnYKmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cypress Home","source_asin":"B013CGA0K8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013CGA0K8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013CGA0K8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879308,"name":"Madame Alexander England Wendy Doll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":150.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t0Ui97L6L._AC_.jpg","description":"This 8 inch classic Wendy is a darling fully articulated vinyl doll. Her fashionably designed look is inspired by England. Wendy has pretty blue eyes and a headful of wild red curls. She's dressed in a black flock tunic that's dotted with pearlized nail heads and two pearl buttons. Beneath her tunic, Wendy wears a white organdy dress with short puffy sleeves and ruffles to match the ruffles at her neckline. White tights and black matte vinyl, lace-up boots are worn beneath the dress while a wide-brimmed black flock hat, with a white feather, sits on her head. A terrific edition to any collection. A 2014 Spring edition by Madame Alexander. Suitable for ages 14 and up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t0Ui97L6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madame Alexander","source_asin":"B00IANSAEM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IANSAEM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IANSAEM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879309,"name":"PIRATE SHIP","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yexmd960L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yexmd960L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPKUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPKUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPKUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
