window.products.push({"id":879458,"name":"SLEEPBELLA Comforter Queen Size, 600 Thread Count Cotton Yellow & Blue Damask with Taupe Brown Reversible Pattern White Comforter Sets,Down Alternativ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eDY+2LMiL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","description":"★COMFORTER SET INCLUDES – 1x Comforter; 2x Pillow Shams. Queen size: Comforter (90\"x 90\"), Pillow Shams(20\"x26\") ★SOFT & COMFORTABLE MATERIAL – Comforter Outer: 600 thread count COTTON. Premium cotton ensures you feel warm in chill weather and stay cool in warm weather by absorbing extra moisture to adjust your climate of comfort all season during your sleep; Comforter Inner Fill: 250gsm whole piece MICROFIBER. It offers a perfect balance between luxurious soft and warmth, also keeps from clumping. ★SELECTED DESIGN – White Comforter pattern with orange, brown and blue damask pattern undertone of the boho comforter. Elegant floral printed pattern infuses your space with harmony and brings you calm and comfort; Stylish Box-Stitching: It will keep the duvet insert from shifting or clumping in order to keep you feel more comfortable during sleep. (Be aware that there might be different fringe orientations of pillow shams between different batches.) ★EASY CARE – Machine wash in the gentle cycle with cold water, sun-dry or tumble dry on low when needed. Do not bleach. Do not wring dry. Also, the features of the cotton fabric ensure a great strength and durability and accompany you through all seasons. *Once opened, we suggest for a quick fluff to revive comforter's original loft. * ★STITCHING DESIGN & CORNER LOOPS: Zig zag shaped quilting prevent the cotton stuffing bunches together. Friendly design by sewing 4 corner loops .You can add a duvet cover to the comforter and secure it in right place easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eDY+2LMiL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLEEPBELLA","source_asin":"B08G589MTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G589MTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G589MTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
