window.products.push({"id":879763,"name":"Tenby Living Corner Shower Caddy - 3 Shelf Shower Organizer Caddie with Movab.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CDnar3QkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A lot goes into your bathing routine and keeping all of those bottles, tubes, cans and jars that you use in the shower organized can be a hassle. You don't want to just keep them on the floor, and moving them in and out of the shower every time you bathe is a pain! That's why you need the Tenby Living Corner Shower Caddy to keep everything neatly organized and in place.   The Tenby Living Corner Shower Caddy transforms the wasted space in the corner of your shower into a spacious storage area for all of your shower essentials. Measuring 13.19 inches in width by 10.43 inches in length by 24.21 inches in height (28.15 inches in height with included spacers), the shower caddy has three levels of storage and a movable soap dish that gives you the perfect place to store anything.   Compared to other shower caddie organizers on Amazon, the Tenby Living Corner Shower Caddy is simply the best because it's:   - MORE SPACIOUS. Even large and awkwardly sized bottles will easily fit on this shower caddy.   - HEIGHT ADJUSTABLE. Add the spacers to increase the height of the plastic shower caddy to 28.15\" to make room for taller bottles. You can also remove one shelf to make it a smaller 2 shelf bathroom shower caddy.   - EASIER TO ASSEMBLE. You can put the corner shower caddy together in minutes without any tools.   - LIGHTWEIGHT YET DURABLE. Plastic shower caddy is easy to move but will hold up to wear and tear.   - EASY TO CLEAN. It's easy to clean, and it has drain holes in the shelves allow water to drain.   - STURDIER. Adjustable feet keep the shower caddie from wobbling and rocking.   Organize your bathroom the simple way with the finest quality bathroom shower caddy on Amazon! Order the Tenby Living Corner Shower Caddy now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CDnar3QkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tenby Living","source_asin":"B01E5262S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E5262S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E5262S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
