window.products.push({"id":879851,"name":"DKLM Meow Cat Lover Mug – Black Cat Coffee Cup Gift for Women and Girls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ojeikm7bS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a cute cat mug for yourself, or as a gift, then this adorable black cat “Meow Mug” is it!   The cute coffee mug is sure to be appreciated, likely to bring a smile to any cat lovers’ face and bound to get a lot of use.   Choosing a present is not always easy but by buying a useful and practical gift you are more likely to ensure that it will be enjoyed for years to come.   Even if the recipient is not a tea or coffee drinker, mugs are universally functional gifts and there is nothing to say that it can’t be used as a pencil holder; or even to hold a small succulent, or catnip for your cat! Filling it with chocolates before giving is also a great gift idea.   Our mugs are made from the highest quality ceramic. The white mugs are imported and then the designs are printed in the United States, using a sublimation process. They are carefully packaged to avoid breakage before being delivered to your door.   When you order, know that your complete satisfaction is our goal! Absolutely love your order or contact us and we will make it right. If for any reason you are not satisfied with your purchase, please let us know and we will happily refund your money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ojeikm7bS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKLM","source_asin":"B07JNJCQ25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNJCQ25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNJCQ25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
