window.products.push({"id":879861,"name":"BeeGeeTees Fold In The Cheese Funny Apron Rose Cooking BBQ Kitchen Barbecue Baking (Text)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HvX-ISkGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Invoke conversations in the kitchen or around the BBQ with this mouth-watering apron (made of high-quality 9.0 oz., 65/35 cotton/polyester blend, it's rugged and wears great too). Ideal for cooking, baking, grilling or bartending, it's perfect for folks of all sizes. Simply slip the apron over your head. Two generous pockets hold utensils and more. 28\" long & 24\" wide. Machine washable. BeeGeeTees Aprons are a 65/35 cotton/polyester blend and your skin will love them. BeeGeeTees clothing was inspired by the lack of unique clothing for adults. By the way, do you know how to catch a unique rabbit? Unique up on it! Ahahahaha! Any who, all BeeGeeTees clothing is designed and printed in the USA. About BeeGeeTees BeeGeeTees is a small, family owned business. Our manufacturing facility is nicked-named “The Imagination Creation Station” and we specialize in designing and making gift items for every occasion. We love love, life, liberty and animals! A portion of your sale will help provide homeless animals with spaying/neutering and care in general. We are the purveyors of \"MANY FUNS\" because “Life is made up of Funs! How many Funs did you have today?” Thank you for stopping by and looking through our funny, charming, sometimes unintentionally offensive and unique gifts. Keep one thing in mind - we're a real live small business, not a huge chain store who imports container loads of cheap trinkets. We hand make everything we sell, and we take a lot of pride in making you happy. We appreciate you and your business!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HvX-ISkGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGeeTees","source_asin":"B08P94KY4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P94KY4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P94KY4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879862,"name":"New Hampshire Whitetail Deer Giclee Art Print Poster from Travel Artwork by Artist Paul A. Lanquist 12\" x 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K13E-lCAL._AC_SL1234_.jpg","description":"This work of art was designed by Artist Paul A. Lanquist (PAL), a Pacific Northwest artist who currently lives in central Oregon. Through the years, PAL has gravitated to the work of illustrators from the 20's, 30's, and 40's that use color and design to communicate their ideas in a straightforward way. By combining the nostalgic look and feel of the past with the spectacular scenery of this country, PAL has created destination and travel posters that capture the beauty and life style of these unique areas. Art print posters are from an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. They are professionally printed at our facilities in the United States on the highest quality art paper using premium, long-lasting art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your art poster will make it a tremendous addition of your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K13E-lCAL._AC_SL1234_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B072M1XQBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072M1XQBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072M1XQBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879863,"name":"Duhome Velvet Vanity Chair with Wheels, Upholstered Task Chair with Arms Height Adjustable Home Office Chair for Bedroom Living Room Study Grey Velvet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L1ac2cymS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💐EXTRA COMFORT: The home office desk chair with well padded seat, backrest and armrest can provide you with maximum comfort. Whether you are working, studying, entertaining or putting on makeup, you will not feel uncomfortable even after a long time. 💐360°ROLLING: This velvet office chair is equipped with 5 high-quality casters, which are made of high-quality materials and can run smoothly in multiple directions without making noise. When you move from one task to another, the 360-degree rotating seat also provides additional convenience. 💐HEIGHT ADJUSTBLE: With a simple push/pull of the lever beneath the seat of the velvet desk chair, you can adjust the seat height from 18\" to 22\" without any difficulty. An SGS-certified gas lift ensures your adjustment safety. 💐MULTIFUNCTION: The swivel chair is perfect for living room, bedroom, home office, reception area, dorm, guest room, and also can be used as task chair in Barber, Salon or Spa. As well as its simple and stylish appearance can be perfectly matched with any style of room. 💐EASY TO ASSEMBLE: For your convenience, all screws have extra backups. Anyone is able to put this rolling desk chair together. Any problems about missing parts and products please feel free to contact us, and we will answer within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L1ac2cymS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duhome Elegant Lifestyle","source_asin":"B08LL2FWVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LL2FWVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LL2FWVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":879864,"name":"Votive Candle Holder. Hand Blown Art Glass in Red.\"Red Red Wine\" - Made in Seattle. Artist Dehanna Jones.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iPbVlSvcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand blown art glass votive candle holder.  Holds 1 tea light or 1 votive candle. Candle holders are fairly thick and sturdy. Approx dimensions 4\" in diameter and 5\" tall; they weigh about 2.5 lbs. Each votive holder is unique in the way the colors blend together. The art glass has a tendency to look completely different when rotated. We try to maximize translucency for brighter colors when lit.  It takes a vision, many hands, four layers of molten glass and two thousand degree furnace to make one glass votive. Each votive is handmade and signed by the artist, but since every one is a unique piece of art, each will shine with its own lively, signature glow when lit.  If you like a votive but prefer a different color mix take a look at the others available. They come in 20 different colors.  Dehanna and Totally Blown Glassworks strive for perfection, but small bubbles, color, and size variations are all indicative of hand blown glass. Soda lime glass is not dishwasher, oven, or microwave safe. Please clean with glass cleaner or warm soapy water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iPbVlSvcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01BMVVEAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BMVVEAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BMVVEAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
