window.products.push({"id":879867,"name":"Masculine Scented Votives- 6 pk.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mM447qoLL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Masculine scented votives are hand poured in small batches to ensure the highest quality possible! They are made from a paraffin blend wax specially formulated for votives. I use only the highest quality wax, fragrance oil and dyes to produce a votive that smells and burns amazing. These masculine scented votives are available in 13 different scents for you to choose from! They come in a package of 6. Quantity- 6 11 different scents to choose from Custom scents and color available ***MASCULINE SCENTS:**** Autumn Lodge- A fresh cedar & evergreen blend that captures all that the mountain woods have to offer. Beer- A beer lover's delight Willow Breeze- Fresh clean breeze thru a willow tree. Green Clover & Aloe- Fresh fragrance of wildflowers, herbs & clover. Spring Rain- Clean refreshing blend w/light fruity notes & hints of florals & spices. Pine- Very strong pine scent like the harvest of Northern Pines. Oak Moss- Blend of Jasmine & rose on undertone of cedarwood & patchouli w/a strong background of moss. Storm Watch- A unique clean fragrance w/subtle floral & spice undertones. Twilight Woods- Combines the scent of ripe forest berries & soft sensual musk w/subtle hints of oak & juniper. China Rain- Soft floral bouquet of violet & rose w/strong body of musk. Mid Summer Night- An energizing, mysterious & powerful masculine scent. Fresh Cut Grass- Smells just like fresh cut grass in the morning. Barn Wood- An exotic combination of sandalwood, pine & cedar w/light notes of warm clove drying to a musky amber background.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mM447qoLL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Custom Candles","source_asin":"B015VFA86E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-879867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015VFA86E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015VFA86E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
